QUERY NAME: qryLastYearsWGTests
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MY_MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, Sum(MY_MonthlyOutput.Volume) AS TestsByWG
FROM MY_MonthlyOutput
WHERE (((fnYearMonth([Year],[month])) Between fnOneYearBackFromMonthReleased() And fnLatestYearMonthReleased()))
GROUP BY MY_MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MY_MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup
ORDER BY MY_MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MY_MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup;

